# Skirmish setup on the procedural UI system (docs/UI-DESIGN.md, mockup Skirmish.dc.html). Units: 1 = frame height / 1080.
# Frame: title top-left, players panel (left, 1104 wide), map and rules panels (right, 656 wide), Back and Start in the
# bottom bar. The players table and the map and rules panels are shared blocks (GameSetup*.layout) used by the LAN setup
# too; this file adds the battle honours, the game-speed slider and the skirmish-only hides.

# the root draws the blueprint frame (IMAGE MainMenuRuler), the dialog frame draws a border, its rule line and two unnamed
# grey boxes draw fills: none of them draw now. The two boxes are matched by their 800x600 rect, before SubParent moves.
hide $SkirmishGameOptionsMenuParent
hide at:58,387,291,499
hide at:300,387,746,499
window $SubParent left top 0 0 1920 1080
hide $SubParent
hide $Line
hide $ButtonResetFPS

# title
window $StaticTextTitle left top 64 40 560 48 title
ruler left top 64 94 560

include GameSetupPlayers.layout

# battle honours: the medal strip (ListboxInfo holds the medal images) above the career record
rule left top 84 740 1064
window $ListboxInfo left top 84 752 1064 92 list
window $StaticTextWins left top 84 868 200 28 meta
window $StaticTextWinsValue left top 290 868 80 28 caption
window $StaticTextLosses left top 84 900 200 28 meta
window $StaticTextLossesValue left top 290 900 80 28 caption
window $StaticTextBestStreak left top 420 868 200 28 meta
window $StaticTextBestStreakValue left top 626 868 80 28 caption
window $StaticTextStreak left top 420 900 200 28 meta
window $StaticTextStreakValue left top 626 900 80 28 caption
window $ButtonReset left top 1008 866 140 36 button

include GameSetupMap.layout
include GameSetupRules.layout

# game speed, left half of the rules panel's top row (StaticTextBattleHonors1 is the Game Speed label in this .wnd)
window $StaticTextBattleHonors1 right top 84 492 240 24 meta
window $SliderGameSpeed right top 150 520 230 44 slider
window $StaticTextGameSpeed right top 84 526 56 32 caption

# bottom bar
window $ButtonBack left bottom 64 40 180 44 button
window $ButtonStart right bottom 64 40 220 44 primary
